## Build your Command Line Interface For Fun
##
## This module provides a small set of combinators for describing
## flags and positional arguments, and turning them into a typed record.
## It allows automated generation of --help output.
package [
    Cli,
] {
    tabulate: "https://github.com/OldIronHorse/tabulate/releases/download/0.0.1/GrMUHhHzrxSXy2rVCnbRMAnWKgePcEPoVU12UJYU8j2q.tar.zst",
    unicode: "https://github.com/roc-lang/unicode/releases/download/4.2.0/4W8SHzvwet9hH9qZewJ1J1CVQoH7YKA6zyijWFTB3y1w.tar.zst",
}
